; Standalone source-plan provider proof: preserve all three ordered origins.
SRCPARTS EQU 8
SRCCHUNK EQU $7500
MMCHKEND EQU $7800
PPGPORT  EQU $E1

            ORG $0010
PPGATE:
            OUT (PPGPORT),A
            RET

            ORG $4000
PPINIT:
            JP SPBEGIN
PPNEXT:
            JP SPNEXT
PPFINISH:
            JP SPEND
PPRETAIN:
            JP SPRETAIN
PPCMP:
            JP SPCMPNAM
PPMAT:
            JP SPMATNAM
PPRET:
            HALT

            ORG $4200
PPCODE:
